msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Hehehe..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ふふふ……。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_30E5E1BB_B7F2_4FAF_BA5D_69954D3BD547
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 39deb11865d891c9de32210a6064e8a7c488f003f48fba2b6e11390c7890a3d6
#. default-sha256: 5da7bad1c6e32ea34e4919b8436319da7bd7a59123452d31296ded6248ae27cd
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_30E5E1BB_B7F2_4FAF_BA5D_69954D3BD547"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You know now who you are, do you not?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You remember everything now, do you "
"not?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫もう、⟪k:3⟫あなた様が誰なのか、⟪k:4⟫分かったのではありませんか？⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫すべて……"
"思い出されたのではありませんか？"

#: scenario4:scenario4_B194619B_C01B_4ED1_A384_43CC74CC0CBD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ca60b507ff604a8ec57f72ef4569f938fc12d8cdb8aff4e126c5a2f3a1520015
#. default-sha256: 82ff6a347261696ffeeaf5716e0982aebff025d66173bfeb34a9f52af8090791
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_B194619B_C01B_4ED1_A384_43CC74CC0CBD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You were present in every single era.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The reason for which is as I described in the "
"previous tale:"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫あなた様は、⟪k:1⟫すべての時代に存在していたのです。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫その理由は、⟪k:4⟫わたくしが今、"
"⟪k:5⟫お見せした通り……。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_74CD1C8A_A4D5_41B2_9FA0_8BACE6033A72
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b50a715be3e84b4ec74c2691e1a9ae714ef5c3e6f46a54a8f71fbf9b287608a9
#. default-sha256: 136d41666fe837ad3442a580d7175f167450febdca2ab8bdaf87e3403c567b2e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_74CD1C8A_A4D5_41B2_9FA0_8BACE6033A72"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫because you yearned to be reunited with someone.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But that person never showed up—"
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫in any era."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫あなた様には、⟪k:1⟫会わねばならない人がいた。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫けれどどの時代にも、⟪k:4⟫その人はいま"
"せんでした。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_AF0F7A7E_BAC4_4A40_9E07_65C1528B46FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 13ed1e064fcb9a7dd346a44b0a5689fcbfc6d2b98af4f2a7d03e0e002b1f1337
#. default-sha256: 28ef712b8662074526480529eaf23af9ca503b221f2c97d66bef2e2b2addb4cb
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_AF0F7A7E_BAC4_4A40_9E07_65C1528B46FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And poor, sweet you, having no memory of any of that..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫おかわいそうに、⟪k:2⟫あなたもその記憶を失い……⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫あなたはあなたであるにも関わら"
"ず……"

#: scenario4:scenario4_E428239F_CEA7_4A3E_8AC2_7DB486476010
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0dee2638407c6d95f1d9a3094d680e0e619d00269214c07fbcd087b047239f48
#. default-sha256: 85f9addfe75f393cd58f16e02785d07cc3f9d3921e02ab097b393f58c7922e78
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E428239F_CEA7_4A3E_8AC2_7DB486476010"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫lived those lives with other men."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫別の殿方との人生を歩んでしまったのです。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_6D4DC32D_2721_4440_ACF6_FDC1CD804679
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4ebe33246fbf1b971ffb13c94076e9d5aa00f4cc48e96e963803b988cc218b7b
#. default-sha256: 722640034416a8dcbe1272901299d878dce2a842c7a3846134809a917f7b576a
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6D4DC32D_2721_4440_ACF6_FDC1CD804679"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Is it any surprise misfortune befell those eras, then?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫それでは不幸も起きるというものでしょう……。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_7184B801_A9A2_4A5A_825E_52C1CB605614
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 75b247ce706dd36a8a122b649a2a67a874eb9d44795e2265c9a33a65fc2f410c
#. default-sha256: 590223015e05619a15f667bc258ba1f3925087db38003632f994152d4b861731
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7184B801_A9A2_4A5A_825E_52C1CB605614"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The door swung closed."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫扉は閉じた。⟪k:1⟫しかし――"

#: scenario4:scenario4_93E5634F_9071_481C_80D5_5D5B3D1A7903
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0fd0732fff725a2bc3e86110d9d617a1421f1aa66535072775608653001a1989
#. default-sha256: 6095d6fed871c7b3a5fdac1fb0f1ad4cede3ff89faa3f3059ec214e1a79dd216
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_93E5634F_9071_481C_80D5_5D5B3D1A7903"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But rather than outside, ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫the Departed⟪k:3⟫ and the Maid were inside the dull, "
"monochrome room at the top of the observation tower."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫「⟪k:1⟫あなた⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫死者⟪k:4⟫」と女中は、⟪k:5⟫扉の内側にいたままだった。⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫物見の塔"
"の光景が、⟪k:8⟫色彩を欠いた状態で目に映っている。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_E4A94C21_3189_4168_A05B_E2C567BCADA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: da84378eda2fd6426403b08a6b6cd3c8c944984c1581490282def6e405ee91a2
#. default-sha256: d267cce7153515636f5d6b550b78d7af712e6f44ab072f75e3ac2d410703983f
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E4A94C21_3189_4168_A05B_E2C567BCADA8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The awe-inspiring ray of light shone not through the lone window high upon the stone wall."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫天井から降り注いでいた神々しい光は、⟪k:1⟫この場にはない。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_9AD4ACE6_C165_4387_AB8B_965A367809DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 62d9a1dd3c2a587112f93fab23c0c1d3a309600e8b9f58bf8bcd1e128929de91
#. default-sha256: cee99544a20c3eb3f40c1a1aca6aca526545b38640049af6f78e00ce9b5968f9
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_9AD4ACE6_C165_4387_AB8B_965A367809DA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Wrapped in a curious, impenetrable darkness, ⟪k:1⟫You both⟪k:2⟫they⟪k:3⟫ stood alone in the "
"room."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫不可思議な暗闇に支配された中――⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫この場にいるのは、⟪k:3⟫「⟪k:4⟫あなた⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫死者"
"⟪k:7⟫」と女中のみ。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_08082BEE_BF0F_49B8_B391_FFAFBAF0D488
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a8dcc8881bd6395db38e7dee9cf9e4ac4cbaab6dc97ff7424a1c3a92a227bd23
#. default-sha256: 745769224dc354069366aeba78b810453c8a84407e24d1cd56117c4d3455ce1d
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_08082BEE_BF0F_49B8_B391_FFAFBAF0D488"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The Maid wore a gentle, but brittlely cold smile as she looked straight at ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫"
"him⟪k:3⟫."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫女中は優しいような、⟪k:1⟫それでいて冷たいような、⟪k:2⟫あやうい微笑を浮かべながら「⟪k:3⟫あなた"
"⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫死者⟪k:6⟫」を見つめている。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_59DA248B_53B8_46EA_97ED_41E3205E4794
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4ee17cb2a0aae00144174935f5af402a9051629a9276371bb1e7c4567d2f0c31
#. default-sha256: e9a8a63cfb8889febeadf2d4d87466708f16d404c3694aca2d616c57bbe7ba3d
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_59DA248B_53B8_46EA_97ED_41E3205E4794"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It is not your fault misfortune befell you.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫The only force to blame for that "
"is fate."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫不幸が起きたのは、⟪k:2⟫あなたが悪いわけではないのです。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫全てはめぐり合わせが悪"
"かっただけのこと……。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_D698B4F1_1523_47BA_BDE8_52FD24FF397F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 65990322ce2601a4e5222c7329a45dd9517d52b9a96b5da446ce39342b2932c8
#. default-sha256: 0dca607045556bcf1459deb3b19b46e0ae7658046be68d96ab787a3ddc6e365b
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_D698B4F1_1523_47BA_BDE8_52FD24FF397F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You were always so kind, so pure of heart.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You had boundless trust for others and "
"the goodness of people."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫あなたはいつでも心優しく、⟪k:1⟫純粋でした。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫人を疑うこともなく、⟪k:4⟫人の優しさを信"
"じ……"

#: scenario4:scenario4_43F9E646_DBDF_49D5_B6CA_BB446B46B564
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5beb9eaf4f09b716b0c147158275de50a4edb6d9b38851709d43f39bb66cdb49
#. default-sha256: d1110f261be89dba3dfa8da50310cee630782ea8fedcdeb0f642c1fff891a9ee
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_43F9E646_DBDF_49D5_B6CA_BB446B46B564"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You were the very image of all that is right."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫善の結晶のようなお人でした。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_7DF46AD4_9E5C_41C1_82A9_9EB6AD8E4082
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4a9254a4114b52253d1eb164e7fe8d34553e400a4707785ea80f57bb9759ee72
#. default-sha256: 528e1db20c32f3e97db4820bc8e661c0d62cfec250d4244498a4e63e0ef04e53
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7DF46AD4_9E5C_41C1_82A9_9EB6AD8E4082"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫There is no greater misfortune⟪k:2⟫than someone as pure and beautiful as you..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫真の不幸というものは……まさにこのことでしょう。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫あなたのように真っ直ぐで美しい人"
"が――"

#: scenario4:scenario4_FCEF73D5_C5F0_4551_8C80_48C163A936CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 260f7d5916f386ed830ce24a966fcd5f256515fca076dfe60dd7123ef5123e1b
#. default-sha256: d399179e6b3fa5ca8193079f372ddee48ec50988c7f9bf4d8410a82c7a515507
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_FCEF73D5_C5F0_4551_8C80_48C163A936CD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫being mercilessly thrown into the grinding gears of tragedy again and again."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫否応なく悲劇の歯車に巻き込まれていく。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_8DB36CD3_1590_4FC9_9E01_681A33745D42
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 07ad40777307ca3d82740132dcaff803db0d1b4618c0ad27d2535b7e9cbf251f
#. default-sha256: bb4bddf2d98968958b419e7fb42d1aac18bf16bbbd2225b917f558a0826788fb
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_8DB36CD3_1590_4FC9_9E01_681A33745D42"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I still pity you for everything you had to go through.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You poor, poor soul..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫わたくし、⟪k:2⟫今でも、⟪k:3⟫哀れに思っております。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫ああ、⟪k:6⟫何てお可哀想な"
"人……。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_067B98EE_A44C_4082_9288_94B79A32DC58
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 633c97fd65991d76e6fbb94d27a8e1af3febcb8c90c4142651e7a4abbc08a1de
#. default-sha256: ad032882fb2e4acd1898fd157707e0e88527ec908e348353d47b0a92d16851ed
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_067B98EE_A44C_4082_9288_94B79A32DC58"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You must be utterly exhausted.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Constantly betrayed, the man you were waiting "
"for never appearing..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫もうお疲れになったでしょう？⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫信じていた人に裏切られ、⟪k:4⟫待っていた人は現れ"
"ず……"

#: scenario4:scenario4_405E2969_551B_4028_B181_8523B24F36F9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c2df7efe81751cd5c192045558c387f7f6139a82c2cc40d096bf301f7545d53c
#. default-sha256: ac63cdb3c9a60e6dcd72f9490fa71fb013f5aadded9d04ac771d81eec3c59407
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_405E2969_551B_4028_B181_8523B24F36F9"
msgid ""
